        ['Esophagus', '**heartburn and regurgitation** — timing with meals, lying down and bending; **atypical chest pain**, night cough, hoarseness, new asthma; foods, drugs and habits that lower LES pressure; weight and BMI; **weight loss** and progressive dysphagia (cancer); older adults\' atypical signs (anemia, anorexia, vomiting, cough).', ['**Heartburn, regurgitation** — meals, lying, bending', '**Atypical chest pain**, night cough, hoarseness, asthma', 'LES-lowering habits; **weight loss** + progressive dysphagia (cancer)']]
